#: aequilibrae/transit/transit.py:160
msgid ""
"Builds a preload vector for the transit network over the specified time period\n"
"\n"
"        :Arguments:\n"
"            **start** (:obj:`int`): The start of the period for which to check pt schedules (seconds from midnight)\n"
"\n"
"            **end** (:obj:`int`): The end of the period for which to check pt schedules, (seconds from midnight)\n"
"\n"
"            **inclusion_cond** (:obj:`str`): Specifies condition with which to include/exclude pt trips from the\n"
"            preload.\n"
"\n"
"        :Returns:\n"
"            **preloads** (:obj:`pd.DataFrame`): A DataFrame of preload from transit vehicles that can be directly "
"used\n"
"            in an assignment\n"
"\n"
"        .. code-block:: python\n"
"\n"
"            >>> project = create_example(project_path, \"coquimbo\")\n"
"\n"
"            >>> project.network.build_graphs()\n"
"\n"
"            >>> start = int(6.5 * 60 * 60) # 6:30 am\n"
"            >>> end = int(8.5 * 60 * 60)   # 8:30 am\n"
"\n"
"            >>> transit = Transit(project)\n"
"            >>> preload = transit.build_pt_preload(start, end)\n"
"\n"
"            >>> project.close()\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"Crée un vecteur de préchargement pour le réseau de transport en commun sur la période spécifiée\n"
"\n"
"        :Arguments :\n"
"            **start** (:obj:`int`) : Le début de la période pour laquelle vérifier les horaires pt (secondes à partir"
" de minuit)\n"
"\n"
"            **end** (:obj:`int`) : La fin de la période pour laquelle vérifier les horaires pt, (secondes à partir de"
" minuit)\n"
"\n"
"            **inclusion_cond** (:obj:`str`) : Spécifie la condition avec laquelle inclure/exclure les trajets pt du\n"
"            précharge.\n"
"\n"
"        :Retours :\n"
"            **preloads** (:obj:`pd.DataFrame`) : un DataFrame de préchargement des véhicules de transport en commun "
"qui peut être directement utilisé\n"
"            dans une mission\n"
"\n"
"        .. bloc de code :: python\n"
"\n"
"            >>> projet = create_example(project_path, \"coquimbo\")\n"
"\n"
"            >>> project.network.build_graphs()\n"
"\n"
"            >>> start = int(6.5 * 60 * 60) # 6h30\n"
"            >>> fin = int(8.5 * 60 * 60) # 8h30\n"
"\n"
"            >>> transit = Transit(projet)\n"
"            >>> préchargement = transit.build_pt_preload(début, fin)\n"
"\n"
"            >>> projet.close()"

