#: aequilibrae/utils/simwrapper/generate_simwrapper_config.py:1
msgid ""
"Utilities to generate SimWrapper dashboard configuration for an AequilibraE project.\n"
"\n"
"Usage\n"
"-----\n"
".. code-block:: python\n"
"    :caption: Generate SimWrapper dashboard for an open project\n"
"\n"
"    >>> from aequilibrae.project import Project\n"
"    >>> from aequilibrae.utils.simwrapper.generate_simwrapper_config import SimwrapperConfigGenerator\n"
"    >>> prj = Project()\n"
"    >>> prj.open('/path/to/project')\n"
"    >>> gen = SimwrapperConfigGenerator(prj, output_dir='simwrapper')\n"
"    >>> gen.write_yamls()\n"
"\n"
"Notes\n"
"-----\n"
"- `output_dir` must be inside the project directory\n"
msgstr ""
"Utilitaires pour générer la configuration du tableau de bord SimWrapper pour un projet AequilibraE.\n"
"\n"
"Utilisation\n"
"-----\n"
".. bloc de code :: python\n"
"    :caption : Générer un tableau de bord SimWrapper pour un projet ouvert\n"
"\n"
"    >>> à partir du projet d'importation aequilibrae.project\n"
"    >>> depuis aequilibrae.utils.simwrapper.generate_simwrapper_config import SimwrapperConfigGenerator\n"
"    >>> prj = Projet()\n"
"    >>> prj.open('/chemin/vers/projet')\n"
"    >>> gen = SimwrapperConfigGenerator(prj, output_dir='simwrapper')\n"
"    >>> gen.write_yamls()\n"
"\n"
"Remarques\n"
"-----\n"
"- `output_dir` doit être dans le répertoire du projet"

